\title{Bereken de hoeken 1}
\language{nl}
\range{-5..5}
\author{Jean-Luc DONADONI}
\email{jluc.donadoni@laposte.net}
\computeanswer{no}
\format{html}
\precision{1000}
\integer{ang = randint(10..70)}
\integer{angle1=36}
\integer{angle2=\ang}
\integer{angle3=180-2*\ang}
\integer{angle4=144-2*\ang}

\statement{<p><center>


\draw{200,200}{
xrange -20,20
yrange -20,20
triangle -15,-11,-15,11,0,11,black
triangle 0,11,4,-11,-9,-2.2,black
triangle -15,-11,-9,-2.2,4,-11,black
triangle 0,11,19,11,4,-11,black
line -4,-7,-2,-5,red
line -5,6,-3,4,red
text black,-17,13,medium,A
text black,-17,-10,medium,B
text black,6,-10,medium,C
text black,18,14,medium,D
text black,0,14,medium,E
text black,-11,0,medium,F
}
</center> <p>
De driehoek <b>ABE</b> heeft een rechte hoek in <b>A</b> en de vierhoek <b>BCDE</b> is een parallellogram.<br>
<font size="+2">&ang;</font> CBE=36<sup>o</sup> en  <font size="+2">&ang;</font> FCE= \ang<sup>o</sup>. &nbsp;
Bereken onderstaande hoeken.}

\answer{ <font size="+2">&ang;</font> AEB &nbsp;=&nbsp;}{\angle1}{type=chset}
\answer{ <font size="+2">&ang;</font> BEC &nbsp;=&nbsp;}{\angle2}{type=chset}
\answer{ <font size="+2">&ang;</font> EFC &nbsp;=&nbsp;}{\angle3}{type=chset}
\answer{ <font size="+2">&ang;</font> FCB &nbsp;=&nbsp;}{\angle4}{type=chset}